      "message_id": "msg-24",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "So: reinstate the measurement snapshot requirement, effective immediately, exactly as it was before — bust, waist, and hip in centimeters, taken when the alteration is logged, required on every entry. And backfill it: any alteration logged between the day we dropped the field and now gets its snapshot added retroactively."
